<li>Richardson, Paul A. "How Great Thou Art." Church Musician 39 (August 1988):9-1 1. A Hymn of the Month article on the text by Carl Boberg as translated by Hine.</li>
<li>Underwood, Byron E. "'How Great Thou Art' (More Facts about its Evolution)." The Hymn 24 (October 1973): 105-108; 25 (January 1974): 5-8.</li>
</ul>
